# Internal workspace files (NEVER commit these)
# Local development scaffolding — workflow notes, ADR working copies,
# tooling-context configs — that should not appear in the public repo.
CLAUDE.md
.claude/
.adrs/
backlog.md
# Note: .sprints/ was gitignored through sprint 2.1.8. Sprint 2.1.9
# (ADR-0011 + the per-game-mode dispatch documentation pass) made
# sprint files PUBLIC because the "where do I see what's planned?"
# answer should live in the public repo. Sprint files going forward
# ship via git; .sprints/2.1.x backfill happened in the 2.1.9 close
# commit. NOT gitignored.

# Audio source / working files (NEVER commit these)
# Raw audio (WAV from generators, untrimmed takes, alternate cuts, etc.) is
# kept locally for reprocessing but never shipped. Only the final encoded
# MP3 in public/assets/audio/ is committed. CREDITS.md tracks license/origin.
#
# Pattern note: `.audio-source/*` (with the trailing /*) ignores everything
# INSIDE the folder while leaving the folder itself un-ignored, so the
# `!README.md` negation below can re-include the docs file. A plain
# `.audio-source/` would ignore the folder wholesale and git would refuse
# to descend into it to find anything to un-ignore.
.audio-source/*
!.audio-source/README.md
*.wav
*.aif
*.aiff
*.flac

# Sprite source / working files (NEVER commit these)
# Raw sprites (PNG exports from generators, Kenney-pack source dumps,
# Photoshop layered exports, etc.) are kept locally for re-processing
# but never shipped. Only the final processed PNG in public/assets/sprites/
# is committed. CREDITS.md tracks license/origin per the same pattern as
# audio. The `*` wildcard pattern is identical to the audio one (descend
# into the folder so the README negation works).
#
# Note: we do NOT add `*.png` here. PNG is the SHIPPED format under
# public/assets/sprites/ — those files MUST be committable. The folder-
# scoped ignore above keeps raw PNGs out of git without affecting
# shipped ones. Other source-only image types are blanket-ignored
# below in case anyone exports as PSD/AI/SVG/WebP intermediate.
.sprite-source/*
!.sprite-source/README.md
*.psd
*.ai
*.xcf
